  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_6297.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El festival de l&#39;Associaci&oacute; Art&iacute;stica i Juvenil de Suera, amb int&egrave;rprets no tan joves, ha recollit un nou &egrave;xit aquest diumenge a la nit al sal&oacute; de la Font Seca, organitzat per Jennifer Aguilar Vizcaino, Roc&iacute;o Ortiz Ortells&nbsp;i persones col&middot;laboradores. Tot en 79 fotos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festivalinfantiljuvenilsuera14/img_6206.jpg\" alt=\"img_6206\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festivalinfantiljuvenilsuera14/img_6207.jpg\" alt=\"img_6207\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festivalinfantiljuvenilsuera14/img_6209.jpg\" alt=\"img_6209\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festivalinfantiljuvenilsuera14/img_6210.jpg\" alt=\"img_6210\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festivalinfantiljuvenilsuera14/img_6212.jpg\" alt=\"img_6212\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festivalinfantiljuvenilsuera14/img_6213.jpg\" alt=\"img_6213\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festivalinfantiljuvenilsuera14/img_6214.jpg\" alt=\"img_6214\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festivalinfantiljuvenilsuera14/img_6215.jpg\" alt=\"img_6215\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festivalinfantiljuvenilsuera1